---
/**
 * HeroSkills.astro : flagship hero core-expertise matrix.
 *
 * v9.4.1 : replaced the animated equity curve (HeroCurve) with a static
 * "what I actually build" matrix. The curve proved paper performance, not
 * employability. A skills matrix wins because it answers a recruiter's
 * first screening questions in 5 seconds:
 *   1. Is he a quant researcher?
 *   2. Can he build production AI?
 *   3. What tools and methods does he use?
 *   4. Is there evidence of meaningful output?
 *
 * Chrome contract: no halo, no glow, no gradient. Mono + 1 amber accent.
 * Sharp 0-2px corners. Hairline rules. Cream canvas + dark inset panel,
 * matching the dark-callout-inside-cream-canvas move from HeroCurve.
 *
 * All copy is sourced from this file (single source of truth for the hero
 * expertise proof). Future updates go here.
 */
---

<aside class="hero-skills" aria-label="Core quantitative research and AI engineering expertise">
  <p class="hero-skills__eyebrow mono">CORE EXPERTISE</p>

  <div class="hero-skills__row">
    <p class="hero-skills__label mono">QUANTITATIVE RESEARCH</p>
    <p class="hero-skills__value">
      Walk-forward validation · deflated Sharpe · cointegration · crypto derivatives
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-skills__row">
    <p class="hero-skills__label mono">AI ENGINEERING</p>
    <p class="hero-skills__value">
      LLM evaluation · RAG · MCP · multi-agent systems
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-skills__row">
    <p class="hero-skills__label mono">PYTHON ENGINEERING</p>
    <p class="hero-skills__value">
      76.5K LOC · 25 public GitHub repositories
    </p>
  </div>
</aside>

<style>
  .hero-skills {
    margin: 0;
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--j-bg);
    color: var(--j-ink);
    border: 1px solid var(--j-rule);
    padding: 22px 24px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 18px;
    border-radius: 0; /* chrome contract: sharp corners */
  }
  .hero-skills__eyebrow {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    color: var(--j-ink-3);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--j-rule);
    padding-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .hero-skills__row {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .hero-skills__label {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--j-amber);
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .hero-skills__value {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--j-ink);
  }
</style>
